																				},
																				"text": {
																					"value_i18n": {
																						"en_US": "<p>Seamlessly integrated with Liferay, this innovative experience with our groundbreaking AWS EKS Infrastructure Provisioning Plugin. Seamlessly integrated with Liferay, this innovative solution revolutionizes the way you manage your infrastructure, saving you time, resources, and headaches.</p>\n\n<p>With just a few clicks, our plugin empowers you to effortlessly set up a robust AWS EKS (Elastic Kubernetes Service) infrastructure tailored specifically for your Liferay instance. No more manual configuration or complex setup processes—our plugin automates the entire deployment process, ensuring a hassle-free experience from start to finish.</p>\n\n<p>Harnessing the power of AWS EKS, our plugin provisions a highly scalable and resilient infrastructure, complete with a state-of-the-art web server, a high-performance database, and a blazing-fast Elasticsearch cluster. Whether you're launching a new Liferay instance or scaling an existing one, our plugin dynamically adapts to your needs, ensuring optimal performance and reliability at all times.</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>"
																					}
