																							"id": "text",
																							"value": {
																								"fragmentLink": {
																								},
																								"text": {
																									"value_i18n": {
																										"en_US": "<ul>\n\t<li>Automated Deployment: Say goodbye to tedious manual setup processes. Our plugin automates the provisioning of your AWS EKS infrastructure, saving you valuable time and effort.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Scalability: Built on AWS EKS, our solution scales seamlessly to accommodate your growing user base and evolving business needs. Whether you're serving hundreds or millions of users, our infrastructure can handle the load with ease.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Reliability: Rest easy knowing that your Liferay instance is backed by a robust and resilient infrastructure. With redundant components and built-in failover mechanisms, downtime is a thing of the past.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Performance: Experience lightning-fast performance thanks to our optimized infrastructure setup. From rapid content delivery to near-instantaneous search results, your users will love the speed and responsiveness of your Liferay instance.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Security: Leverage AWS's industry-leading security features to protect your data and ensure compliance with regulations. With encrypted communication, fine-grained access controls, and regular security updates, your infrastructure is locked down tight.<br>\n\t&nbsp;</li>\n\t<li>Cost Efficiency: Optimize your infrastructure costs with our plugin's intelligent resource management capabilities. Pay only for what you use, and eliminate wasteful spending on idle resources. Unlock the full potential of Liferay with our AWS EKS Infrastructure Provisioning Plugin. Streamline your operations, enhance your performance, and elevate your user experience—all with just a few clicks. Try it today and see the difference for yourself.</li>\n</ul>"
																									}
																								}
																							}
																						}
																					],
